#: ../../source/tcp-port-used_README.md:72
msgid "check(port [, host])"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tcp-port-used_README.md:73
msgid ""
"Checks if a TCP port is in use by attempting to connect to the port on "
"host. If no host is specified, the module uses '127.0.0.1' (localhost). "
"When the promise is resolved, there is a parameter `inUse`, when true "
"means the port is in use and false means the port is free."
msgstr ""

